IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PEN0011.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    COPY PEN0011C REPLACING ==:PFX:== BY ==AC==.
01 RESULT-AREA.
    *> PENALTY WAIVER FLAG
    05 PW-IND             PIC X VALUE 'N'.
    *> LATE PAYMENT PENALTY
    05 L-CG               PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
A000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM FIRST-OFFENSE-WAIVER
    DISPLAY "PW-IND=" PW-IND
    DISPLAY "L-CG=" L-CG
    STOP RUN.
FIRST-OFFENSE-WAIVER.
    IF AC-WS-FOF = 'Y'
        EVALUATE TRUE
            *> PREMIUM FIRST-OFFENCE WAIVER
            WHEN AC-L-TR = 'G' OR AC-L-TR = 'P'
                MOVE 'Y' TO PW-IND
                MOVE 0 TO L-CG
            WHEN AC-D-PD <= 3
                MOVE 'Y' TO PW-IND
                MOVE 0 TO L-CG
        END-EVALUATE
    END-IF.
